cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its accompanying evaluation dataset, please cite
  the archived v2.0.0 release using the version-specific DOI below.
title: COSPEC Comparison Harness and Evaluation Dataset
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Seo
    given-names: Yongjin
    affiliation: Chungnam National University
    email: yongjin.seo@rtst.co.kr
version: 2.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23121544"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SeoNebys/cospec-harness"
abstract: >-
  An automated comparison harness and complete 150-trial evaluation dataset for
  COSPEC, Spec-Driven Development, and vibe coding. Includes 600 Claude/Codex
  judgments and reproducible descriptive, permutation, and agreement analyses.
  Client roles are simulated by LLMs.
keywords:
  - COSPEC
  - large language models
  - requirements elicitation
  - specification
  - reproducibility
